Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.62,0:00:04.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,地球軍原本打算以蘇伊士為據點
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.83,0:00:11.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一口氣攻佔邁赫穆爾 地中海口 和我們的直布羅陀基地
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.70,0:00:14.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但現在卻無法如願
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.52,0:00:18.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為何？理由在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.95,0:00:23.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那真到現在都不和薩拉隊長說話？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.44,0:00:27.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊　拿他沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.17,0:00:30.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真還真是個小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.06,0:00:35.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以前你說在奧布的初島上失去了家人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.13,0:00:38.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我是說被殺 被阿斯哈
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.23,0:00:42.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是　所以你就為此而有了這種想法嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.91,0:00:45.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那時候只要有力量…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.17,0:00:49.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只要得到力量…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.89,0:00:52.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.88,0:00:58.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,曾為自己的無力哭泣過的人　誰都會這麼想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.53,0:01:00.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大概...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.79,0:01:05.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但獲得這份力量之時開始
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.12,0:01:09.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你自己就會成為悲劇的製造者
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.67,0:01:12.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這點絕對別忘記
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,儚く散った光が
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕らを今呼び覚ます
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しみは音を立て
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,消えるあの場所から
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,深く愛する
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,勇氣と希望強く
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,感じるこの記憶が
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絡み合う心と
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ココロをつないで
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,動き出している
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,輝く光が照らし
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕らを今呼び起こす
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,響きあう音を立て
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,刻むこの場所から
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,永久に信じ続けて…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,PHASE-18　討伐Lohengrin！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.30,0:02:56.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,即將抵達地點A
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.32,0:02:58.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,科尼路的信號呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.37,0:03:00.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還沒傳來
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.78,0:03:04.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,貨艙門準備好了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.16,0:03:05.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.49,0:03:09.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,通過地點A後 轉移為紅色狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.52,0:03:12.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,駕駛員到待機室集合
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.14,0:03:13.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.34,0:04:00.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,當地協助人員 也就是反抗組織？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.45,0:04:02.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是這樣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.17,0:04:06.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聽說加魯納漢的城市狀況很淒慘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.09,0:04:17.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是小孩子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.63,0:04:18.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就座
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.82,0:04:21.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,終於要開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.87,0:04:25.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來開始說明與拉德爾隊共同進行的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.26,0:04:30.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,加魯納漢Lohengrin閘門突破作戰詳細情況
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.19,0:04:34.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如大家所知 這是塊難啃的硬骨頭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.55,0:04:36.39,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(632,628)}{\fad(300,300)\fs36}地球連合軍 Lohengrin砲台
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.41,0:04:37.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,之前拉德爾隊雖然也曾嘗試突破
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.87,0:04:40.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卻以失敗告終
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.72,0:04:45.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次呢 阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.30,0:04:49.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來請你來說
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.01,0:04:52.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.53,0:04:57.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是被稱為加魯納漢Lohengrin閘門的溪谷狀況
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.14,0:05:00.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這座懸崖對面有座城市
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.60,0:05:03.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在更深處就是火力發電廠
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.10,0:05:07.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只有這條路能從這裡抵達那座城市
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.24,0:05:12.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但敵人的陽電子炮台被設置在這個高點
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.48,0:05:14.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,覆蓋整個溪谷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.70,0:05:18.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,去到哪裡都進入敵人射程內 無處藏身
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.56,0:05:24.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,即使使用超長距離射擊攻擊敵炮台或其身下的岩體
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.22,0:05:30.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡除MS外還設置有裝備陽電子反射器的MA
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.31,0:05:33.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無法造成有效打擊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.40,0:05:41.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,據說你們在奧布海域遭遇了相同裝備的MA？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.79,0:05:43.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.70,0:05:46.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那這次的作戰…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.59,0:05:50.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,做掉那個MA 搞定炮台
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.78,0:05:52.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,進入加魯納漢不就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.19,0:05:57.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.54,0:06:01.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們就是在討論該如何做到 真
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.21,0:06:05.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我做得到 只要想幹
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.36,0:06:06.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那就靠你了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.12,0:06:09.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們在後方靜候佳音吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.24,0:06:12.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,突破了記得告訴我們一聲
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.11,0:06:15.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.85,0:06:20.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,先不扯這些了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.06,0:06:23.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,科尼路小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.98,0:06:24.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.93,0:06:28.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是那位駕駛員 把資料給他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.94,0:06:31.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這傢伙？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.21,0:06:31.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.61,0:06:37.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.01,0:06:42.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次作戰成功與否關鍵就看那位駕駛員吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.45,0:06:44.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題嗎 這樣的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.77,0:06:45.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.81,0:06:48.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,科尼路小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.37,0:06:49.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是隊長嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.06,0:06:52.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你去不是更好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.77,0:06:56.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,失敗的話 城裡的人們這次就真的完了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.94,0:06:58.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.77,0:07:02.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 科尼路小姐也是 别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.37,0:07:05.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此 阿斯蘭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.46,0:07:10.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這倒是沒想過
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.88,0:07:12.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,副艦長也來了 別這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.22,0:07:14.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真給我坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.61,0:07:21.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他能做到 沒問題的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.12,0:07:23.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,資料給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.42,0:07:32.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.83,0:07:34.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.38,0:07:37.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,按她說的 你去不就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.32,0:07:40.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,失敗了就真的完了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.50,0:07:43.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那還不如自己來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.97,0:07:46.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是這麼想的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.56,0:07:49.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 別說孩子氣的話
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.95,0:07:57.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明知不行還讓你去 很不巧我沒有體貼你的心情到這種地步
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.33,0:08:01.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,認為你不行我就會自己去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.73,0:08:06.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但我認為你能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.00,0:08:08.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以選擇了這套方案
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.67,0:08:13.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,況且之前口氣那麼大 現在卻打退堂鼓了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.96,0:08:21.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,即將抵達地點B
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.37,0:08:24.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,距離敵炮台射程15000
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.79,0:08:28.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真他們呢 快到作戰開始地點了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.19,0:08:31.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿瑟呢 他去幹什麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.52,0:08:32.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.21,0:08:36.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,即將抵達地點B 作戰開始地點
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.24,0:08:38.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,各工作人員請待命
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.65,0:08:40.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,特萊茵副艦長請來艦橋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.06,0:08:47.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了 還想說什麼嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.53,0:08:54.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,上次ZAFT攻擊炮台後 城裡可亂了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.01,0:08:59.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為與此同時城市裡也發起了抵抗運動
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.72,0:09:07.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,違抗地球軍的人們遭到非人的待遇
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.89,0:09:09.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還有不少人被殺
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.01,0:09:13.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次也是 如果失敗不知道會怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.65,0:09:16.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以絕對希望你們幹掉那座炮台
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.01,0:09:19.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次一定要
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.65,0:09:24.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.61,0:09:37.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真了不起啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.03,0:09:41.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真很難駕馭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.62,0:09:44.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們從進軍校開始就在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.62,0:09:46.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總是那副樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.73,0:09:49.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他老愛頂撞教官或者長官
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.23,0:09:53.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你卻能駕馭住 讓他聽話
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.43,0:09:56.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是呢 駕馭什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.52,0:09:59.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他很多地方都挺蹩腳的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.02,0:10:02.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但不是個壞傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.86,0:10:08.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,人際交往方面 我也不算什麼高手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.00,0:10:15.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我被打預防針了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.40,0:10:17.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.17,0:10:25.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到達B點
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.82,0:10:27.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好 作戰開始
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.16,0:10:29.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,告知馬格尼和Minerva
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.98,0:10:31.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,MS隊出擊準備
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.62,0:10:34.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Impulse出擊準備
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.77,0:10:36.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,駕駛員到核心戰機
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.40,0:10:38.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,中央彈射器 啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.36,0:10:40.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,氣密閘門封鎖
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.75,0:10:44.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,中央彈射器 升至發射位置
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.93,0:10:46.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,核心戰機全系統啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.94,0:10:50.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦橋遮蔽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.46,0:10:52.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對MS戰鬥準備
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.72,0:10:53.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Impulse出擊後
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.24,0:10:56.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到德斯蒙德  馬格尼前方
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.18,0:11:00.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,CIWS  Tristan  Isolde啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.70,0:11:01.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射管1  7
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.89,0:11:04.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,1號至5號 全炮門裝填Parsifal
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.87,0:11:09.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,X23S-Saviour 阿斯蘭機
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.47,0:11:10.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,出擊準備
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.62,0:11:13.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全系統啟動確認完畢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.85,0:11:17.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,氣密閘門封鎖
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.87,0:11:19.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,彈射器準備完畢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.35,0:11:22.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷 查 巴勒路 Blaze Zaku Phantom
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.49,0:11:23.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射準備
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.70,0:11:25.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全系統啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.13,0:11:27.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開始發射程序
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.16,0:11:32.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艙門開啟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.23,0:11:34.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,彈射系統接合確認
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.98,0:11:36.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,彈射器推進力正常
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.50,0:11:40.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,進路無阻 核心戰機出擊 請
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.65,0:11:45.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 飛鳥 核心戰機出動
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.29,0:11:51.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,彈射器接合
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.99,0:11:54.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,胸部組件發射 請
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.49,0:11:57.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,腿部組件發射 請
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.55,0:12:07.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,區域1有熱源接近
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.02,0:12:11.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,緊急起飛 MS隊立即出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.77,0:12:13.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,識別 ZAFT軍地面戰艦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.14,0:12:16.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,勒賽普斯級1 皮特裡級1
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.82,0:12:19.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以及…這是Minerva
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.94,0:12:23.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ZAFT 好了傷疤又忘痛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.38,0:12:25.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,帶來新型艦也是一樣下場
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.71,0:12:29.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Lohengrin啟動 Gerzu-Geh出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.88,0:12:32.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,進路無阻 能量管道分離確認
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.98,0:12:36.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,YMFG-X7D Gerzu-Geh 允許出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.63,0:12:44.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡有條當地人也知之甚少的坑道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.93,0:12:48.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,裡面不夠寬 MS當然是無法通過的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.24,0:12:53.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但正好通向炮塔下方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.28,0:12:55.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然現在出口已經封鎖了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.63,0:12:57.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但只要稍微爆破就能穿過
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.41,0:12:59.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.86,0:13:09.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這怎麼回事 一片漆黑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.40,0:13:13.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 真的只能靠資料啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.92,0:13:20.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然MS不行 但Impulse能穿過
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.77,0:13:22.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,按資料飛就行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.16,0:13:25.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,問題不在那裡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.18,0:13:29.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.06,0:13:34.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們由正面吸引敵軍炮塔 引開MA
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.90,0:13:39.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你通過這條坑道直接攻擊炮塔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.44,0:13:46.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼「我認為你能做到」啊 那混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.11,0:13:49.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只不過是自己不想做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.18,0:13:54.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你若是太慢 我們就會被包圍
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.25,0:13:58.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,太快也不行 無法完全引開
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.59,0:13:59.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.72,0:14:03.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,做給你看 可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.84,0:14:13.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,進路無阻  Saviour出擊 請
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.72,0:14:17.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭 薩拉  Saviour出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.24,0:14:30.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷 查 巴勒路  Zaku出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.69,0:14:35.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜瑪莉雅 霍克  Zaku出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.55,0:14:39.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好 展開
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.91,0:14:52.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,上升 Tannhauser啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.58,0:14:55.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,照準時注意射線軸後方
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.16,0:14:57.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別連累城市
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.37,0:15:00.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,把MA誘至前方
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.52,0:15:01.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.85,0:15:04.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Tannhauser照准 敵軍MS群
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.25,0:15:07.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,主武器艙連接
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.56,0:15:09.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,額定輸出 解除保險
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.27,0:15:12.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,敵戰艦陽電子炮發射狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.11,0:15:15.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,MS隊成為目標
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.76,0:15:17.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,反射器展開
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.28,0:15:20.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,上前 擋給他們看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.99,0:15:24.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.46,0:15:50.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,上 也盡量引開敵軍MS隊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.54,0:15:51.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.30,0:15:55.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,仗著自己也有陽電子炮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.59,0:15:58.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,打算地面上虛晃一槍從上空攻擊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.94,0:16:00.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嘛 想法不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.40,0:16:03.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但你們沒有盾牌
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.53,0:16:04.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Lohengrin照准
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.17,0:16:07.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,目標 上空敵軍戰艦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.95,0:16:09.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,敵軍炮台 照准本艦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.01,0:16:12.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,引擎最大 下降 避開
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.52,0:16:13.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.18,0:16:16.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.29,0:16:33.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.25,0:16:38.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快充填能量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.41,0:16:40.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,召回Gerzu-Geh
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.10,0:16:42.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Dagger隊在幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.76,0:16:49.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那傢伙退了 露娜瑪莉雅
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.52,0:17:11.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,終點 這裡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.71,0:17:12.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,距離500
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.21,0:17:15.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.02,0:17:24.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.94,0:17:44.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麼 迎擊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.10,0:17:46.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,收回Lohengrin
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.90,0:17:53.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.71,0:17:56.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,把那MS打下來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.05,0:18:20.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.72,0:18:23.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.07,0:19:28.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.85,0:19:52.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聯合軍全部殺光 一個不留
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.56,0:20:32.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了 阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.76,0:20:35.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,之後交給拉德爾隊就行
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.26,0:20:37.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,回來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.63,0:20:38.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.01,0:20:41.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿瑟 盡快報告船艦狀況
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.90,0:20:43.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.16,0:20:54.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.15,0:20:58.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,受傷了嗎 你這樣的人也會?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.37,0:21:01.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.37,0:21:03.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,作戰成功了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.26,0:21:09.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 大功告成
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.99,0:21:11.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幹得好 真
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.26,0:21:13.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,多虧有你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.72,0:21:15.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哪裡 沒有的事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.09,0:21:20.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但那任務太苛刻了 我真以為要掛了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.27,0:21:26.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,黑成那樣 你怎麼不早說
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.37,0:21:28.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.63,0:21:31.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是說了嗎「只能靠資料」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.13,0:21:34.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 話是沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.31,0:21:36.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 你克服了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.15,0:21:38.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是做到了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.50,0:21:41.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這我也說了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.75,0:21:43.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,話是沒錯…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.85,0:21:47.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,回去吧 我們的任務完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,涙で滲んだ  この時空を  見上げるたび
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,儚い蒼さが  胸を締めつけてく
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,運命なら  哀しみの果てまで
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戦い続けた  日々を跡に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Life Goes On　燃え上がる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,命がある限り
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真実の自分さえ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,見失いそう　それでも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Life Goes On　守りたくて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,心は砕かれて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本当の哀しみを知った瞳は
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,愛に溢れて....
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.28,0:23:24.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,勝利意味著喜悅
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.20,0:23:26.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是所有人的追求
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.66,0:23:28.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沸騰的人群之中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.93,0:23:30.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,出現了歌姬的身影
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.27,0:23:31.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,頌揚他們
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.68,0:23:35.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,然而一切都沒有結束
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.23,0:23:39.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,同行的狄蘭達爾所說的「戰爭內幕」是…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.84,0:23:43.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下集　機動戰士GUNDAM SEED DESTINY
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.19,0:23:45.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,看不見的真實
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.14,0:23:47.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,向著一時平靜的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.19,0:23:49.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,飛翔吧 Zaku
